WEBVTT

NOTE Module: Node.js

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.273
Module 6 focuses on Node.js server architecture. We examine libuv thread pools, non-blocking I/O, event emitters, and graceful process lifecycle management.

2
00:00:11.273 --> 00:00:20.887
Notice how pipeline streams data directly from source to destination with automatic backpressure management, preventing out-of-memory errors on large payloads.

3
00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:30.105
Synchronous CPU-intensive work blocks the single-threaded event loop, stalling all concurrent users. Offload heavy processing to worker threads.

4
00:00:30.105 --> 00:00:38.704
Complete the stream processing lab to demonstrate non-blocking server architecture and record verified Node.js competency in your passport.
